  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Gu Immortal finds a six headed snake dead body and sells its parts and organs separately in treasure yellow heaven. The six headed snake is a desolate beast with strength comparable to rank six Gu Immortals; its whole body is a treasure and every part can be used in Gu refinement. With no black blood left on the century-dead carcass, Fang Yuan still buys the whole skeleton for three immortal essence stones, because the bone marrow can produce blood and he knows how to extract it.",
      "chapters": [
        682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bought-without-blood",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Hu Immortal blessed land’s western blood pool, the six headed snake’s skeleton bobs while a Gu formation consumes it to create black blood, with rank five Battle Bone Wheel as the core.",
      "chapters": [
        682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bought-without-blood",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "gu_battle_bone_wheel_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Two days later the six headed snake’s large skeleton has completely melted in the blood pool, and Fang Yuan obtains a great amount of black blood from it.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "skeleton-melts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The six headed snake’s bones have turned into black blood and been fed to Calamity Beckoning Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turned-into-feed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_calamity_beckoning_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later recalls that buying a six headed snake’s skeleton had cost only three immortal essence stones, when weighing another four-stone expense.",
      "chapters": [
        712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
